  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.09 Clean Water Act (CWA)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.09 “Clean Water Act (CWA)” means the federal Clean Water Act, 33 U.S.C. Chapter 26, Water Pollution Prevention and Control, §§1251 - 1387.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22 (formerly Env-Wq 502.08)",
